    {
      "id": "DV-01",
      "category": "data_verification",
      "question": "NIST CODATA(2018) 给出的摩尔气体常数 R 是多少？图谱节点 TH:pq:gas_const 记录的值是否与之相符（相对误差 ≤1e-9）？",
      "method": "lookup_constant",
      "inputs": {
        "graph_node": "TH:pq:gas_const",
        "quantity": "R"
      },
      "expected": {
        "kind": "value",
        "value": 8.314462618,
        "unit": "J mol^-1 K^-1",
        "rel_tol": 1e-09
      },
      "split": "test"
    },
    {
      "id": "DV-02",
      "category": "data_verification",
      "question": "由 N_A 与 k_B 复算摩尔气体常数 R=N_A·k_B，结果是否与 CODATA 的 R 一致？",
